601	commit 7f38171c399721a81be79423f2b3b46dc973c826
602	Author: Alexander Victor Ocsa Mamani <aocsa.cs@gmail.com>
603	Date:   Thu Sep 3 18:20:40 2026 +0000
604	
605	    feat(starrocks-fe): plan FILES() scans with real row counts instead of 1
606	    
607	    The FE planned every FILES() scan at 1 row: 22/22 TPC-H plans had
608	    card_all_one=True and all 126 exchanges were costed from column widths,
609	    so join sides, BROADCAST/SHUFFLE and CTE decisions were data-blind (one
610	    CN broadcast 3.79e9 lineitem rows into q04's semi join). StatisticsCalculator
611	    now asks TableFunctionTable for the count: the parquet footer total when the
612	    compute node reports one (next commit), else total file bytes divided by the
613	    typed row width of the inferred schema, the same rule HiveStatisticsProvider
614	    uses without statistics. Column statistics stay unknown. The mutable FE config
615	    files_scan_estimate_row_count (default true) restores the 1-row plans for an
616	    EXPLAIN COSTS A/B on one running FE.
617	    
618	    Ships as patches/files-scan-row-count.patch on the StarRocks submodule
619	    (pointer unchanged); the bench scripts set and read back cbo_cte_reuse=false
620	    on a patched FE, since real costs let the CBO keep a CTE materialised and
621	    the CN refuses MULTI_CAST_DATA_STREAM_SINK.
622	    
623	    Tested: FE JUnit TableFunctionTableTest, StatisticsCalculatorTest and the new
624	    FilesScanStatisticsTest (fake:// 3072 B / 20 B = 153 rows; injected 1e9 vs 10
625	    rows gives INNER JOIN (BROADCAST) with the small side building, and the FE
626	    commutes LEFT SEMI to RIGHT SEMI); patch set applies from a clean submodule in
627	    glob order and is idempotent; fe-build 269 s.
628	    
629	    Left: the CN translator has no RIGHT_SEMI_JOIN arm, needed before the knob is
630	    on in any sweep; this does not make q05 q08 q09 q17 q18 q21 pass on 1 CN.
631	    
632	    Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
